{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>And Many More 是一款為你重視的人而設的生日追蹤工具，適合經常忘記親友生日、又想保持聯繫的人使用。你可以把每位親友的生日集中記錄，在合適時間收到溫馨提醒，之後直接致電、傳訊息、發電郵，或把生日加入日曆。程式沒有廣告、沒有訂閱，也不會收集你的資料。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>集中管理親友生日</h2>\n<p>開啟 And Many More，所有生日會按即將到來的次序排列成清單，一眼看清下一位生日主角。新增方式靈活：手動輸入、從聯絡人匯入，或載入 CSV、TSV、Excel 與 Google Sheets 試算表。你可按姓名、備註、聯絡資料或標籤搜尋，設定預設提醒時間，並為個別親友自訂提醒與提示訊息，亦可選擇程式主題色。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-59-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-60-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-61-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-62-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-63-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-64-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：And Many More: Birthday Alerts</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-05T23:19:06.977095+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":386,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}